---
const benefits = [
  {
    title: 'Recupera tu lugar en la calle',
    description: 'Ride es la plataforma que valora tu experiencia y tu concesión. Vuelve a competir con tecnología hecha para ti.',
    icon: `<svg class="w-7 h-7" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="2"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M12 8c-1.657 0-3 .895-3 2s1.343 2 3 2 3 .895 3 2-1.343 2-3 2m0-8c1.11 0 2.08.402 2.599 1M12 8V7m0 1v8m0 0v1m0-1c-1.11 0-2.08-.402-2.599-1M21 12a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z"/></svg>`,
  },
  {
    title: 'Tú mandas en tus horarios',
    description: 'Trabaja cuando tú quieras, como siempre ha sido. Sin jefes, sin horarios impuestos. Tu taxi, tus reglas.',
    icon: `<svg class="w-7 h-7" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="2"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M12 8v4l3 3m6-3a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z"/></svg>`,
  },
  {
    title: 'Pagos puntuales cada semana',
    description: 'Recibe tus ganancias semanalmente de forma segura vía Stripe Connect. Tu esfuerzo, tu dinero, sin retrasos.',
    icon: `<svg class="w-7 h-7" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="2"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M17 9V7a2 2 0 00-2-2H5a2 2 0 00-2 2v6a2 2 0 002 2h2m2 4h10a2 2 0 002-2v-6a2 2 0 00-2-2H9a2 2 0 00-2 2v6a2 2 0 002 2zm7-5a2 2 0 11-4 0 2 2 0 014 0z"/></svg>`,
  },
  {
    title: 'Soporte mexicano 24/7',
    description: 'Un equipo en México que te entiende y te respalda las 24 horas. Porque mereces atención de primer nivel.',
    icon: `<svg class="w-7 h-7" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="2"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M18.364 5.636l-3.536 3.536m0 5.656l3.536 3.536M9.172 9.172L5.636 5.636m3.536 9.192l-3.536 3.536M21 12a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0zm-5 0a4 4 0 11-8 0 4 4 0 018 0z"/></svg>`,
  },
];
---

<section id="conductores" class="py-20 lg:py-32 bg-white">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <div class="grid lg:grid-cols-2 gap-16 items-center">
      <!-- Left - Visual -->
      <div class="fade-up order-2 lg:order-1 flex justify-center" style="transition-delay: 0.2s;">
        <div class="relative w-full max-w-md">
          <!-- Earnings card -->
          <div class="bg-black rounded-3xl p-8 text-white shadow-2xl">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-8">
              <img src="/image_logo.png" alt="Ride" class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl" />
              <div>
                <div class="text-sm text-gray-400">Panel del taxista</div>
                <div class="font-bold">Resumen semanal</div>
              </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Earnings -->
            <div class="text-center mb-8">
              <div class="text-sm text-gray-400 mb-1">Ganancias esta semana</div>
              <div class="text-5xl font-black text-primary">$8,450</div>
              <div class="text-sm text-gray-400 mt-1">MXN</div>
            </div>

            <!-- Stats grid -->
            <div class="grid grid-cols-3 gap-4 mb-8">
              <div class="bg-white/5 rounded-2xl p-4 text-center">
                <div class="text-2xl font-bold text-white">32</div>
                <div class="text-xs text-gray-400">Viajes</div>
              </div>
              <div class="bg-white/5 rounded-2xl p-4 text-center">
                <div class="text-2xl font-bold text-white">4.9</div>
                <div class="text-xs text-gray-400">Rating</div>
              </div>
              <div class="bg-white/5 rounded-2xl p-4 text-center">
                <div class="text-2xl font-bold text-white">18h</div>
                <div class="text-xs text-gray-400">En línea</div>
              </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Progress bar -->
            <div class="mb-2 flex justify-between text-sm">
              <span class="text-gray-400">Meta semanal</span>
              <span class="text-primary font-bold">85%</span>
            </div>
            <div class="w-full bg-white/10 rounded-full h-3">
              <div class="bg-primary h-3 rounded-full" style="width: 85%;"></div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Floating notification -->
          <div class="absolute -bottom-4 -right-4 bg-white rounded-2xl p-4 shadow-xl border border-gray-100 flex items-center gap-3">
            <div class="w-10 h-10 bg-green-100 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center">
              <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-green-600" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="2">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"/>
              </svg>
            </div>
            <div>
              <div class="text-sm font-bold text-black">Pago enviado</div>
              <div class="text-xs text-gray-400">Stripe Connect</div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Right - Content -->
      <div class="order-1 lg:order-2">
        <div class="fade-up inline-flex items-center gap-2 bg-primary/10 text-black px-4 py-2 rounded-full text-sm font-semibold mb-4">
          <span class="w-2 h-2 bg-primary rounded-full"></span>
          Para el taxista mexicano
        </div>
        <h2 class="fade-up text-3xl sm:text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-black text-black mb-6" style="transition-delay: 0.1s;">
          Tu segunda
          <span class="text-primary"> oportunidad</span>
          empieza aquí
        </h2>
        <p class="fade-up text-lg text-gray-500 mb-10" style="transition-delay: 0.2s;">
          Fuiste el primero en mover a México. Ahora Ride te da la tecnología que mereces para volver a ser la mejor opción de transporte.
        </p>

        <div class="space-y-5">
          {benefits.map((benefit, index) => (
            <div class="fade-up flex gap-4 group" style={`transition-delay: ${0.2 + index * 0.1}s;`}>
              <div class="flex-shrink-0 w-14 h-14 bg-gray-50 rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center text-primary border border-gray-200 group-hover:bg-primary group-hover:text-black group-hover:border-primary transition-all duration-300 shadow-sm">
                <Fragment set:html={benefit.icon} />
              </div>
              <div>
                <h3 class="font-bold text-black mb-1">{benefit.title}</h3>
                <p class="text-gray-500 text-sm leading-relaxed">{benefit.description}</p>
              </div>
            </div>
          ))}
        </div>

        <div class="fade-up mt-10" style="transition-delay: 0.6s;">
          <a href="#descarga" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 bg-black hover:bg-gray-800 text-primary font-bold px-8 py-4 rounded-full transition-all hover:scale-105 active:scale-95">
            Únete como taxista Ride
            <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="2">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M17 8l4 4m0 0l-4 4m4-4H3"/>
            </svg>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
